  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership 1: Good Governance and Economic Growth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INJ899, established in 2011 under the Tuvalu Australia Partnership for Development (2009), had one priority outcome: to support long term economic prospects in Tuvalu&apos;s?National Strategy for Sustainable Development 2005-2015. The objectives covered Australia&apos;s annual contributions to the Tuvalu Trust Fund (TTF). In 2012, Policy Reform Matrix (PRM) Budget Support assistance to Tuvalu was added to INJ899. The Australia-Tuvalu Aid Partnership was updated (2017-2020). The Australia-Tuvalu Aid Investment Plan (2016-17 to 2019-20) sits under the Australia-Tuvalu Aid Partnership (2017-2020). During COVID-19, INJ899 was expanded under the Australia Tuvalu COVID-19 Development Response Plan (October 2020) in line with Australia&apos;s Partnerships for Recovery.</narrative>
  </description>
